# BL-010 Phase 4.9 — path-scoped ownership, replacing the catch-all
# `* @AsemDevs`. CODEOWNERS patterns are evaluated last-match-wins, so the
# root-infra fallback is listed first and each packages/<name>/ entry below
# it narrows ownership for that subtree. All owners are currently the same
# person; the point of this change is the STRUCTURE (so per-package owners
# can be added independently later), not a change in who reviews what today.

# Root infra fallback: anything not matched by a more specific pattern below
# (workspace config, root scripts, docs, changesets, CI, etc.)
*                               @AsemDevs

# Root-level infra, explicit for clarity even though the fallback above
# already covers these.
/.github/                      @AsemDevs
/.changeset/                   @AsemDevs
/scripts/                      @AsemDevs
/docs/                         @AsemDevs
/package.json                  @AsemDevs
/package-lock.json             @AsemDevs
/CODEOWNERS                    @AsemDevs

# Packages
/packages/OpenPlanr/            @AsemDevs
/packages/planr-pipeline/       @AsemDevs
/packages/skills/               @AsemDevs
/packages/marketplace/          @AsemDevs
